  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coffee Explorative Visit- Dutch Private Sector Engagement 2026 in preparation for GV4G.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This mission is positioned within the context of the GV4G programme and applies a Dutch Diamond approach to bring together a diverse group of relevant stakeholders from the private sector, NGOs, carbon experts and knowledge institutions. It is an ideal opportunity for them to explore how they can actively contribute to building Mozambique&#x2019;s coffee sector and creating sustained momentum from an early stage. Timing this trip in conjunction with the EU Global Gateway Business Forum in Maputo increases the likelihood of participation in both and enables stakeholders to maximise their time in-country. Given the early stage of development, this is a timely opportunity to engage Dutch actors to shape the value chain from the outset.</narrative>
  </description>
